{"step_index":118,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T09:00:29Z","content":"Your frontend HUD is now connected to **BE 2's live server** at `172.18.238.74:8000`.\n\nBoth [`frontend/index.html`](file:///C:/Users/Piyush/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/aegis_os/frontend/index.html) and the [aegis_mission_control.html](file:///C:/Users/Piyush/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e426a91e-3961-4012-84ca-1849c4385ef7/aegis_mission_control.html) artifact have been updated with all 4 requirements.\n\n---\n\n### 🔌 What Was Implemented\n\n```\n                       ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n                       │                   BE 2 Live Backend Server                  │\n                       │                        (172.18.238.74:8000)                 │\n                       └──────────────┬───────────────────────────────┬──────────────┘\n                                      │                               │\n           1. GET /api/memory/graph   │                               │ 2. ws://.../ws/telemetry\n           (Initial graph sync)       │                               │    (Streaming events)\n                                      ▼                               ▼\n                       ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n                       │                     FE 1 Mission Control HUD                │\n                       ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n                       │  • [WS: LIVE] Status badge in top navigation bar            │\n                       │  • Live Warning Alert: Button relocated by Δx=+120px         │\n                       │  • Flashing Emerald Card: SELF_HEALING_COMPLETED            │\n                       │  • Node Color Shift: Turns Emerald Green (#10b981)          │\n                       └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n#### 1. Live WebSocket Telemetry (`ws://172.18.238.74:8000/ws/telemetry`)\n* **Live Status Badge in Header**: Displays `#ws-status-badge` (`WS: LIVE` in green with a glowing dot when connected, or `WS: RECONNECTING IN 4s...` in amber if the server is restarting).\n* **Auto-Reconnection**: Resilient auto-reconnect loop every 4 seconds.\n\n#### 2. \"MEMORY_DRIFT_DETECTED\" Handler\n* When this event arrives:\n  1. A **warning alert card** drops down from the top:\n     `⚠ MEMORY DRIFT DETECTED [BE2 TELEMETRY]: Button relocated by Δx=+120px`\n  2. The button physically translates by **$+120\\text{px}$** (`transform: translateX(120px)`), changing to amber styling with text `>> SUBMIT [RELOCATED +120px] <<`.\n  3. The canvas renders a dashed relocalization vector pointing from the original coordinates to the new coordinates.\n  4. System status turns amber: `⚡ DRIFT DETECTED (Δx=+120px) // RELOCALIZING`.\n  5. The telemetry terminal logs the event with `[WARN]` tag, and plays the audio chime.\n\n#### 3. \"SELF_HEALING_COMPLETED\" Handler\n* When this event arrives:\n  1. Automatically dismisses the warning alert and flashes a glowing **emerald success card**:\n     `✔ SELF_HEALING_COMPLETED [BE2 TELEMETRY]: Target re-anchored at new coordinates.`\n  2. The submit node turns **emerald green (`#10b981`)** on both the canvas and the landmark node table.\n  3. Status pill updates to `✔ ADAPTATION COMPLETE // MUSCLE MEMORY SYNCED`.\n  4. Memory graph confidence updates to `100.0%`.\n\n#### 4. Initial Memory Graph Bootstrap\n* On page load (`DOMContentLoaded`), executes:\n  ```javascript\n  GET http://172.18.238.74:8000/api/memory/graph?task_id=vendor_payout_task\n  ```\n* Automatically maps all returned spatial nodes into the canvas and table.\n* **Fail-Safe Fallback**: If BE 2 is momentarily unreachable, it logs a notice and loads local cached baseline nodes so the UI never crashes or stays blank.\n\n---\n\n### 🧪 How to Test It Right Now\n\n1. **Launch the frontend in your browser**:\n   ```powershell\n   start C:\\Users\\Piyush\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\aegis_os\\frontend\\index.html\n   ```\n2. **Testing with BE 2 live on Wi-Fi**:\n   * As soon as BE 2 runs their FastAPI / WebSocket server, the top badge will turn green: `WS: LIVE (172.18.238.74:8000)`.\n   * When BE 2 dispatches `\"MEMORY_DRIFT_DETECTED\"`, watch the alert and $+120\\text{px}$ shift.\n   * When BE 2 dispatches `\"SELF_HEALING_COMPLETED\"`, watch the green card flash and the node turn `#10b981`.\n\n3. **Offline Simulation Mode (Before BE 2 is online)**:\n   We also added test buttons directly in the footer bar so you can test and rehearse immediately:\n   * Click **`[⚡ Test BE2 Drift (+120px)]`** $\\to$ triggers the drift alert and button shift.\n   * Click **`[✔ Test BE2 Healed]`** $\\to$ triggers the emerald success card and `#10b981` node shift.\n   * Click **`[↺ Reconnect WS]`** $\\to$ manually retries connection to BE 2's IP."}
