{"step_index":130,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T09:40:48Z","thinking":"**Observing Telemetry Audit**\n\nThe system displays a \"Live Audit Telemetry\" stream. There are currently three entries logged. This suggests ongoing activity that may provide insights into recent operations.\n\n\n**Analyzing Log Data Categories**\n\nThe telemetry data may be categorized to provide clarity. Initial assessment suggests categorizing log entries by \"motor,\" \"memory,\" and \"hypervisor\" components. Applying the proposed categorization logic to identify and filter the logs.\n\n\n**Implementing Log Categorization Logic**\n\nThe provided function's logic is applied to categorize log messages.  The function uses keyword detection to assign each log entry to \"motor,\" \"memory,\" or \"hypervisor\" categories, or \"all\" if no keywords match. This structured classification will facilitate focused analysis of telemetry data.\n\n\nI'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"@'\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfiles = [\n    Path(r\"C:\\Users\\Piyush\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\aegis_os\\frontend\\index.html\"),\n    Path(r\"C:\\Users\\Piyush\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\e426a91e-3961-4012-84ca-1849c4385ef7\\aegis_mission_control.html\")\n]\n\nfilter_chips_html = '''          <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <span>Live Audit Telemetry</span>\n            <span id=\"log-count\" class=\"text-slate-500 font-normal\">FILTERED VIEW</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Subsystem Log Filter Chips -->\n          <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-1.5 mb-2 font-mono text-[10px]\">\n            <button onclick=\"filterLogs('all')\" id=\"filter-btn-all\" class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-700/50\">ALL</button>\n            <button onclick=\"filterLogs('motor')\" id=\"filter-btn-motor\" class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 hover:text-white border border-transparent\">MOTOR</button>\n            <button onclick=\"filterLogs('memory')\" id=\"filter-btn-memory\" class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 hover:text-white border border-transparent\">MEMORY</button>\n            <button onclick=\"filterLogs('hypervisor')\" id=\"filter-btn-hypervisor\" class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 hover:text-white border border-transparent\">HYPERVISOR</button>\n          </div>'''\n\njs_filter_code = '''    let currentLogFilter = 'all';\n\n    function categorizeLogMessage(msg, explicitCategory = null) {\n      if (explicitCategory) return explicitCategory;\n      const lower = msg.toLowerCase();\n      if (lower.includes(\"motor\") || lower.includes(\"cursor\") || lower.includes(\"actuation\") || lower.includes(\"type\") || lower.includes(\"click\") || lower.includes(\"settle\") || lower.includes(\"voucher\") || lower.includes(\"payout\")) {\n        return \"motor\";\n      }\n      if (lower.includes(\"memory\") || lower.includes(\"drift\") || lower.includes(\"re-anchor\") || lower.includes(\"relocaliz\") || lower.includes(\"heal\") || lower.includes(\"node\") || lower.includes(\"be2\") || lower.includes(\"landmark\")) {\n        return \"memory\";\n      }\n      if (lower.includes(\"boundary\") || lower.includes(\"hypervisor\") || lower.includes(\"breach\") || lower.includes(\"intercept\") || lower.includes(\"snapshot\") || lower.includes(\"invariant\") || lower.includes(\"proof\") || lower.includes(\"pob\") || lower.includes(\"contract\") || lower.includes(\"attack\") || lower.includes(\"policy\")) {\n        return \"hypervisor\";\n      }\n      return \"all\";\n    }\n\n    function addLog(msg, type = \"info\", category = null) {\n      const log = document.getElementById(\"telemetry-log\");\n      if (!log) return;\n      const d = new Date();\n      const timeStr = `[${d.toTimeString().split(' ')[0]}]`;\n      const div = document.createElement(\"div\");\n      div.className = \"py-0.5 log-entry transition-all\";\n\n      const cat = categorizeLogMessage(msg, category);\n      div.setAttribute(\"data-category\", cat);\n\n      if (type === \"warn\") div.className += \" text-amber-400\";\n      else if (type === \"crit\") div.className += \" text-rose-400 font-bold\";\n      else if (type === \"success\") div.className += \" text-emerald-400\";\n      else div.className += \" text-cyan-400\";\n\n      div.innerText = `${timeStr} ${msg}`;\n\n      if (currentLogFilter !== 'all' && cat !== currentLogFilter && cat !== 'all') {\n        div.style.display = \"none\";\n      }\n\n      log.appendChild(div);\n      log.scrollTop = log.scrollHeight;\n    }\n\n    function filterLogs(category) {\n      currentLogFilter = category;\n      const buttons = {\n        all: document.getElementById(\"filter-btn-all\"),\n        motor: document.getElementById(\"filter-btn-motor\"),\n        memory: document.getElementById(\"filter-btn-memory\"),\n        hypervisor: document.getElementById(\"filter-btn-hypervisor\")\n      };\n\n      Object.entries(buttons).forEach(([key, btn]) => {\n        if (!btn) return;\n        if (key === category) {\n          btn.className = \"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-700/50 font-bold shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(56,189,248,0.25)]\";\n        } else {\n          btn.className = \"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 hover:text-white border border-transparent\";\n        }\n      });\n\n      const entries = document.querySelectorAll(\"#telemetry-log > div\");\n      let visibleCount = 0;\n      entries.forEach(entry => {\n        const cat = entry.getAttribute(\"data-category\") || categorizeLogMessage(entry.innerText);\n        entry.setAttribute(\"data-category\", cat);\n        if (category === 'all' || cat === category || cat === 'all') {\n          entry.style.display = \"block\";\n          visibleCount++;\n        } else {\n          entry.style.display = \"none\";\n        }\n      });\n\n      const countLabel = document.getElementById(\"log-count\");\n      if (countLabel) {\n        countLabel.innerText = category === 'all' ? `${entries.length} ENTRIES` : `${visibleCount} ${category.toUpperCase()}`;\n      }\n    }'''\n\nold_title_snippet = '''          <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">\n            <span>Live Audit Telemetry</span>\n          </div>'''\n\nold_addlog_func = '''    function addLog(msg, type = \"info\") {\n      const log = document.getElementById(\"telemetry-log\");\n      const d = new Date();\n      const timeStr = `[${d.toTimeString().split(' ')[0]}]`;\n      const div = document.createElement(\"div\");\n      div.className = \"py-0.5\";\n\n      if (type === \"warn\") div.className += \" text-amber-400\";\n      else if (type === \"crit\") div.className += \" text-rose-400 font-bold\";\n      else if (type === \"success\") div.className += \" text-emerald-400\";\n      else div.className += \" text-cyan-400\";\n\n      div.innerText = `${timeStr} ${msg}`;\n      log.appendChild(div);\n      log.scrollTop = log.scrollHeight;\n    }'''\n\nfor f in files:\n    content = f.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    \n    # 1. Replace HTML title with Title + Filter Chips\n    if 'id=\"filter-btn-motor\"' not in content:\n        if old_title_snippet in content:\n            content = content.replace(old_title_snippet, filter_chips_html)\n        else:\n            print(\"Warning: old_title_snippet not matched directly, using regex replacement\")\n            content = content.replace('<span>Live Audit Telemetry</span>\\n          </div>', '<span>Live Audit Telemetry</span>\\n          </div>\\n' + filter_chips_html)\n\n    # 2. Replace addLog with the new filter-aware addLog + filterLogs functions\n    if 'function filterLogs' not in content:\n        if old_addlog_func in content:\n            content = content.replace(old_addlog_func, js_filter_code)\n        else:\n            print(\"Warning: old_addlog_func not matched directly, injecting before addLedgerRecord\")\n            content = content.replace('function addLedgerRecord', js_filter_code + '\\n\\n    function addLedgerRecord')\n\n    f.write_text(content, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"Updated filter chips in {f.name}\")\n'@ | python -\n","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\Piyush\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\aegis_os","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Adding filter chips","toolSummary":"Add filter chips and JS logic to frontend"}}]}
